{"parse":{"title":"【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇","pageid":3151,"revid":6703,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E8%96%87%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7%E7%AF%87&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E8%96%87%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7%E7%AF%87&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E8%96%87%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7%E7%AF%87&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.90.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E7.BA.AA.E4.BA.8B.E7.B0.BF.E3.80.91.E8.96.87.E5.B0.94.E5.BE.B7.E7.AF.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇\">【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E8%96%87%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7%E7%AF%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：极心测试的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-19 15:18<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FS5FCZBMkm76p9H_gGw2r3Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S5FCZBMkm76p9H_gGw2r3Q</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>各位团长好！<br />\n今天给大家带来的是<br />\n<font color=\"green\"><b>薇尔德部族</b></font>的介绍<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息222.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a6/ca5kwuvmjgdb7tvpbfbq2excyjsg2mt.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF222.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"191\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a6/ca5kwuvmjgdb7tvpbfbq2excyjsg2mt.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF222.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a6/ca5kwuvmjgdb7tvpbfbq2excyjsg2mt.png/300px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF222.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1374\" /><img alt=\"官方消息160.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/a7vq7wb84pph4k1n5zfz0sueqlv2kyz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>薇尔德部族<font color=\"green\"><b>根源古老</b></font>，族人无论男女，都是骁勇善战的勇士。然而，<font color=\"green\"><b>战火连绵</b></font>使得薇尔德部族的利益屡次遭受侵害，不但<font color=\"green\"><b>部族退居薇尔塔深山，领土也遭受了故意分割</b></font>...<br />长期以来，薇尔德族民逐渐变成了外界<font color=\"green\"><b>歧视</b></font>和<font color=\"green\"><b>剥削</b></font>的对象，骁勇的<font color=\"green\"><b>力量</b></font>被浪费在<font color=\"green\"><b>最底层的工作中</b></font>，<font color=\"green\"><b>能歌善舞</b></font>则更使得薇尔德舞女被推向<font color=\"green\"><b>奴隶贸易</b></font>的<font color=\"green\"><b>深渊</b></font>..\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息223.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/s8ukkljxvbl23j4kid1epgnlq4kitgi.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF223.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"849\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/s8ukkljxvbl23j4kid1epgnlq4kitgi.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF223.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/s8ukkljxvbl23j4kid1epgnlq4kitgi.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF223.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1833\" /><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n<font color=\"green\"><b>血泪般的历史</b></font>并未击垮他们的意志<br />\n薇尔德<font color=\"green\"><b>寻求生存发展的愿景与信心</b></font>从未改变<br />\n即便<font color=\"green\"><b>坎坷</b></font>，他们也从未迷路<br />\n因为<font color=\"green\"><b>薇尔塔的山风</b></font>，会引领部族走向<font color=\"green\"><b>光明的方向</b></font>...\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2182/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.220      1 -total\n 52.15%   19.409      1 模板:面包屑\n 47.55%   17.699      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3151-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163730 and revision id 6703. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息222.png","官方消息160.png","官方消息223.png","官方消息162.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇"}],"displaytitle":"【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=【铃兰纪事簿】薇尔德篇=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间= 2023-09-19 15:18\n|作者=极心测试的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S5FCZBMkm76p9H_gGw2r3Q\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br>\n[[File:官方消息139.png|link=]]\n<center>\n各位团长好！<br>\n今天给大家带来的是<br>\n<font color=green>'''薇尔德部族'''</font>的介绍<br>\n[[File:官方消息222.png|150px|link=]][[File:官方消息160.png|link=]]\n{|style=\"width:90%\"\n|薇尔德部族<font color=green>'''根源古老'''</font>，族人无论男女，都是骁勇善战的勇士。然而，<font color=green>'''战火连绵'''</font>使得薇尔德部族的利益屡次遭受侵害，不但<font color=green>'''部族退居薇尔塔深山，领土也遭受了故意分割'''</font>...<br>长期以来，薇尔德族民逐渐变成了外界<font color=green>'''歧视'''</font>和<font color=green>'''剥削'''</font>的对象，骁勇的<font color=green>'''力量'''</font>被浪费在<font color=green>'''最底层的工作中'''</font>，<font color=green>'''能歌善舞'''</font>则更使得薇尔德舞女被推向<font color=green>'''奴隶贸易'''</font>的<font color=green>'''深渊'''</font>..\n<br><br>\n|}\n[[File:官方消息223.png|500px|link=]][[File:官方消息162.png|link=]]\n<font color=green>'''血泪般的历史'''</font>并未击垮他们的意志<br>\n薇尔德<font color=green>'''寻求生存发展的愿景与信心'''</font>从未改变<br>\n即便<font color=green>'''坎坷'''</font>，他们也从未迷路<br>\n因为<font color=green>'''薇尔塔的山风'''</font>，会引领部族走向<font color=green>'''光明的方向'''</font>...\n</center>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:31.323852+00:00"}